
There are two Collectors: The Network Observer, and the Mini-Collector

The Network Observer receives things from all over the network, and
builds up the overall picture of the network.

The Mini-Collector just gets info about the current state of links, 
listeners, and connectors so the Controller can update the .status 
fields of the CRs

The Network Observer gives its info to the Console -- visualization --
and the Controller so it can update the CRs.
